      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "URBAN TIGER (5) had the drop on the lead from the squeeze box but wound up strongly to score (17.39) at this track in Grade 5 over 300m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Form reads well for this. DOLLY DAWN (1) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 3.5 lengths at this track in a handy 17.53 beating MY DINOSAUR. Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Can make it back-to-back wins. MY DINOSAUR (2) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind DOLLY DAWN (17.78) in a Grade 5. Got back and turned spotting a start but found the line impressively. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Can feature again. LUNAR MOON (4) generally performs well here at this distance.",
